      <activity id="658264d8-3bab-5e9e-a8d0-07a87204df8e" activityNameId="06c092c9-c7b3-5ec0-9789-7b0f7e70c3da" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">xxx Sawn timber, softwood, raw, kiln dried, u=10%, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: xxx Sawn timber, softwood, raw, kiln dried, u=10%, at plant
Drying time: 9 days;
Synonyms: Fichte, Spruce; 
UUID: d4b708c9-52d3-30a9-8628-a06a7573f20f
Includes kiln drying of wet wood (u=70%) down to u=10%, and shrinkage. Air emissions released from the wood are not accounted for because the same emissions would occur if the wood would not be used. Kiln is assumed to be located on the sawmill site. No transports are considered.
Location: &lt;null&gt;
Technology: Technology mix used in Germany (1986)
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: Literature 
Extrapolations: see Geography and Technology
Uncertainty adjustments: The assumption that the German technology mix is representative for central Europe is considered in the uncertainties.
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_d4b708c9-52d3-30a9-8628-a06a7573f20f.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
